  _glyph: "\U0001F412\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: Bound to the Golden Cap
  _description: He and his band must obey whoever owns the [[f49fc573-16e3-4e9f-af2f-0765f661f274|Golden
    Cap]], three times each. They serve the [[be9e56ee-6d1f-425c-bb06-5f87fd88d22e|Wicked
    Witch of the West]] until [[fcbf3650-903d-4ed3-a6f8-79e222116920|Dorothy Gale]]
    wins the Cap.
  _sortOrder: 12
